  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Forestal (CADEFOR)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Forestry (CADEFOR)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Apoyo de USAID al sector forestal en Bolivia a trav&#xe9;s del Centro de Desarrollo Forestal Amaz&#xf3;nico (CADEFOR). CADEFOR es una instituci&#xf3;n sustentable formada por un equipo profesional calificado, que asiste a los actores del sector forestal en la cuenca amaz&#xf3;nica, fortaleciendo las capacidades locales, brindando servicios de calidad para el manejo forestal sustentable, apoyando la adopci&#xf3;n de mejores pr&#xe1;cticas y generando oportunidades productivas en la comercializaci&#xf3;n de productos forestales, contribuyendo as&#xed; al alivio de la huella ambiental.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">USAID support for the forestry sector in Bolivia through the Amazon Center for Forestry Development (CADEFOR). CADEFOR is a sustainable institution formed by a qualified professional team, which assists the players in the forestry sector in the Amazon basin, strengthening local capacity, providing quality services for sustainable forest management, supporting the adoption of best practices and generating productive opportunities marketing of forest products, thus contributing to the alleviation of environmental footprint.</narrative>
  </description>
